  "ruleText": "Saf-C 803.03 Telephone Line Used. Alarms shall be connected so as to ring the telephone number prescribed by the receiving agency.\n\nSource. #2282, eff 1-16-83; ss by #2791, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5068, eff 2-21-91; ss by #6457, INTERIM, eff 2-21-97, EXPIRES: 6-21-97; ss by #6474, eff 3-25-97; ss by #8307, INTERIM, eff 3-25-05, EXPIRES: 9-21-05; ss by #8392, eff 7-22-05; EXPIRED: 7-22-13\n\nNew. #12771, eff 5-2-19",
